.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-17T14:31:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T18:49:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nObserved on Godot  stable-4.4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable (4c311cbee) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6800 (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.12033.1030) - AMD Ryzen 5 7600 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAdjusting GPU/CPU Particles2D's **Amount Ratio** is the reccomended way to dynamically reduce or increase the amount of particles being emmitted without restarting the particle system.\n\nLowering **Amount Ratio** causes particles to no longer be emitted in a consistent manner, introducing periods without emission and periods with concentrated emission.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd38c0e8-34ee-4a57-8352-309eabb1d7ec\n\nEmission should remain at a constant rate with a fixed interval between each particle.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe listed settings of my GPU Particles 2D, explosiveness remains at zero.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4719bf6-ef36-4dcc-bf2b-d71888ad2662)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP added\n\n[AmountRatioBugMRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19290483/AmountRatioBugMRP.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104276/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104276/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}